NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000565 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000566 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000567 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000568 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000569 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000570 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000571 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000572 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000573 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000574 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000575 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000576 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000577 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000578 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000579 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000580 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000581 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000582 ""
